<title>CHINA: China c. bank sees no need for interest change-paper.</title>
<headline>China c. bank sees no need for interest change-paper.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's economy is growing at a healthy rate and there is no need for further changes in interest rates now, a senior central bank official was quoted on Friday as saying.</p>
<p>Chen Yuan, vice governor of the People's Bank of China, was also quoted in the Asian Wall Street Journal as saying the central bank believed the nation's curreny, the yuan, was at an acceptable level.</p>
</text>
